2026-07-29 17:11:13,270 - openai._base_client - DEBUG:505 - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'headers': {'X-Stainless-Raw-Response': 'true'}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-e8611045-b83d-4914-bd44-3ce88d3a78e8', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'content': "You are AI智能问数's system-configuration assistant.\nUse the provided tools to query and configure AI智能问数 metadata,\nincluding datasources, tables, fields, table relationships, terminology and\ndictionary fields.\n\nRules:\n1. Use only the provided tools. Never invent tools or execute free-form SQL.\n2. Never run business DML or DDL against customer databases.\n3. Use read tools to resolve ids and current state before a mutation when needed.\n4. Treat tool schemas and descriptions as the source of truth for arguments.\n5. When replacing a complete collection, first read the current collection unless\n   the user explicitly supplied the full desired state.\n6. Tool errors are facts: explain them and suggest a safe next step; never claim a\n   failed mutation succeeded.\n7. Never repeat passwords, tokens, secrets or complete connection credentials.\n8. After a mutation, clearly summarize what changed and include useful ids/names.\n9. Reply in the same language as the user.\n10. Use prior conversation turns for context, but re-query mutable system state\n   instead of assuming it is unchanged.\n11. Data preview is only for validating configured metadata. Direct analytics and\n    chart generation belong in the main intelligent-query conversation.\n12. A claim that current configuration was inspected or changed must be supported\n    by a successful tool result from this turn. Report only ids and values present\n    in tool results; never invent operation or relationship ids.\n13. If the request is purely general guidance and genuinely needs no system tool,\n    prefix the final answer with [[NO_SYSTEM_ACTION]]. The runtime removes\n    this transport marker before showing the answer.\n", 'role': 'system'}, {'content': "我想要查询“帮我按系统维度统计一下研发二部每月系统task数、story数”， 下面的两个sql 相比哪个更准确？\n\nSELECT dim.`系统名称`,\n       dim.`月份`,\n       COALESCE(task_agg.`task数`, 0) AS `task数`,\n       COALESCE(story_agg.`story数`, 0) AS `story数`\nFROM\n  (SELECT DISTINCT p.`project_name` AS `系统名称`,\n                   DATE_FORMAT(t.`create_time`, '%Y-%m') AS `月份`\n   FROM `d_task` t\n   JOIN `d_project` p ON t.`project_id` = p.`id`\n   JOIN `d_user` u ON t.`dispatch_to_name` = u.`name`\n   WHERE u.`organization_name` IN ('研发二部',\n                                   '联易融组织架构/战略客户业务公司/产研与交付/技术研发中心/研发二部',\n                                   '三中心研发二部(废弃组织)')\n     AND t.`deleted` = '0'\n     AND t.`create_time` >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND t.`create_time` < '2027-01-01'\n   UNION SELECT DISTINCT p.`project_name` AS `系统名称`,\n                         DATE_FORMAT(s.`create_time`, '%Y-%m') AS `月份`\n   FROM `d_story` s\n   JOIN `d_project` p ON s.`project_id` = p.`id`\n   JOIN `d_user` u ON s.`dispatch_to_name` = u.`name`\n   WHERE u.`organization_name` IN ('研发二部',\n                                   '联易融组织架构/战略客户业务公司/产研与交付/技术研发中心/研发二部',\n                                   '三中心研发二部(废弃组织)')\n     AND s.`deleted` = '0'\n     AND s.`create_time` >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND s.`create_time` < '2027-01-01') dim\nLEFT JOIN\n  (SELECT p.`project_name` AS `系统名称`,\n          DATE_FORMAT(t.`create_time`, '%Y-%m') AS `月份`,\n          COUNT(t.`id`) AS `task数`\n   FROM `d_task` t\n   JOIN `d_project` p ON t.`project_id` = p.`id`\n   JOIN `d_user` u ON t.`dispatch_to_name` = u.`name`\n   WHERE u.`organization_name` IN ('研发二部',\n                                   '联易融组织架构/战略客户业务公司/产研与交付/技术研发中心/研发二部',\n                                   '三中心研发二部(废弃组织)')\n     AND t.`deleted` = '0'\n     AND t.`create_time` >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND t.`create_time` < '2027-01-01'\n   GROUP BY p.`project_name`,\n            DATE_FORMAT(t.`create_time`, '%Y-%m')) task_agg ON dim.`系统名称` = task_agg.`系统名称`\nAND dim.`月份` = task_agg.`月份`\nLEFT JOIN\n  (SELECT p.`project_name` AS `系统名称`,\n          DATE_FORMAT(s.`create_time`, '%Y-%m') AS `月份`,\n          COUNT(s.`id`) AS `story数`\n   FROM `d_story` s\n   JOIN `d_project` p ON s.`project_id` = p.`id`\n   JOIN `d_user` u ON s.`dispatch_to_name` = u.`name`\n   WHERE u.`organization_name` IN ('研发二部',\n                                   '联易融组织架构/战略客户业务公司/产研与交付/技术研发中心/研发二部',\n                                   '三中心研发二部(废弃组织)')\n     AND s.`deleted` = '0'\n     AND s.`create_time` >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND s.`create_time` < '2027-01-01'\n   GROUP BY p.`project_name`,\n            DATE_FORMAT(s.`create_time`, '%Y-%m')) story_agg ON dim.`系统名称` = story_agg.`系统名称`\nAND dim.`月份` = story_agg.`月份`\nORDER BY dim.`系统名称`,\n         dim.`月份`\nLIMIT 1000;\n\n\nSELECT all_dims.month AS `month`,\n       all_dims.project_id AS `project_id`,\n       p.project_name AS `project_name`,\n       COALESCE(t.task_count, 0) AS `task_count`,\n       COALESCE(s.story_count, 0) AS `story_count`\nFROM\n  (SELECT DATE_FORMAT(t1.create_time, '%Y-%m') AS `month`,\n          t1.project_id\n   FROM `d_task` t1\n   WHERE t1.project_id IN\n       (SELECT p1.id\n        FROM `d_project` p1\n        WHERE p1.organization_id IN\n            (SELECT o1.id\n             FROM `d_organization` o1\n             WHERE o1.organization_name LIKE '%研发二部%'\n               AND o1.deleted = '0'))\n     AND t1.create_time >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND t1.create_time < '2027-01-01'\n   UNION SELECT DATE_FORMAT(s1.create_time, '%Y-%m') AS `month`,\n                s1.project_id\n   FROM `d_story` s1\n   WHERE s1.project_id IN\n       (SELECT p2.id\n        FROM `d_project` p2\n        WHERE p2.organization_id IN\n            (SELECT o2.id\n             FROM `d_organization` o2\n             WHERE o2.organization_name LIKE '%研发二部%'\n               AND o2.deleted = '0'))\n     AND s1.create_time >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND s1.create_time < '2027-01-01') AS all_dims\nLEFT JOIN\n  (SELECT DATE_FORMAT(t2.create_time, '%Y-%m') AS `month`,\n          t2.project_id,\n          COUNT(*) AS `task_count`\n   FROM `d_task` t2\n   WHERE t2.project_id IN\n       (SELECT p3.id\n        FROM `d_project` p3\n        WHERE p3.organization_id IN\n            (SELECT o3.id\n             FROM `d_organization` o3\n             WHERE o3.organization_name LIKE '%研发二部%'\n               AND o3.deleted = '0'))\n     AND t2.create_time >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND t2.create_time < '2027-01-01'\n   GROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(t2.create_time, '%Y-%m'),\n            t2.project_id) AS t ON all_dims.month = t.month\nAND all_dims.project_id = t.project_id\nLEFT JOIN\n  (SELECT DATE_FORMAT(s2.create_time, '%Y-%m') AS `month`,\n          s2.project_id,\n          COUNT(*) AS `story_count`\n   FROM `d_story` s2\n   WHERE s2.project_id IN\n       (SELECT p4.id\n        FROM `d_project` p4\n        WHERE p4.organization_id IN\n            (SELECT o4.id\n             FROM `d_organization` o4\n             WHERE o4.organization_name LIKE '%研发二部%'\n               AND o4.deleted = '0'))\n     AND s2.create_time >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND s2.create_time < '2027-01-01'\n   GROUP BY DATE_FORMAT(s2.create_time, '%Y-%m'),\n            s2.project_id) AS s ON all_dims.month = s.month\nAND all_dims.project_id = s.project_id\nLEFT JOIN `d_project` p ON all_dims.project_id = p.id\nORDER BY all_dims.month,\n         all_dims.project_id\nLIMIT 1000", 'role': 'user'}, {'content': '这是一个很好的SQL比较问题。让我从几个维度来分析这两个SQL的差异：\n\n## 两个SQL的核心差异\n\n| 维度 | SQL 1 | SQL 2 |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| **筛选逻辑** | 按**人员所属部门**筛选 | 按**项目所属组织**筛选 |\n| **关联方式** | `task/story.dispatch_to_name = user.name` → `user.organization_name` | `project.organization_id = organization.id` → `organization.organization_name` |\n| **匹配方式** | 精确匹配 `IN (...)` 多个组织名 | 模糊匹配 `LIKE \'%研发二部%\'` |\n| **维度粒度** | `project_name` + 月份 | `project_id` + 月份（再JOIN获取name） |\n\n## 关键业务含义差异\n\n**SQL 1** 筛选的是：\n> "分配给**研发二部人员**的所有task/story"\n\n**SQL 2** 筛选的是：\n> "**项目所属组织是研发二部**的所有task/story"\n\n---\n\n## 哪个更准确？\n\n这取决于"研发二部"的业务含义：\n\n### 如果需求是「研发二部这个团队的工作量」→ **SQL 1 更准确**\n- 统计的是研发二部人员被分配的任务\n- 一个人可能参与多个项目，这些都会被统计\n- 更符合"按部门维度统计工作量"的常见需求\n\n### 如果需求是「研发二部负责的项目的工作量」→ **SQL 2 更准确**\n- 统计的是组织架构上归属于研发二部的项目\n- 项目内的任务不管是哪个部门的人做的都会被统计\n- 更符合"按项目归属统计"的场景\n\n---\n\n## SQL质量方面的额外观察\n\n| 方面 | SQL 1 | SQL 2 |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| **可维护性** | 硬编码3个组织名，需手动维护 | 模糊匹配，但也可能匹配到不相关的 |\n| **数据准确性** | 精确匹配，结果可控 | `LIKE` 可能匹配到"研发二部XX小组"等子组织 |\n| **性能** | 需要JOIN用户表，可能较慢 | 通过organization_id关联，可能更高效（如果有索引） |\n\n---\n\n## 我的建议\n\n从实际业务场景来看，**统计"研发二部每月系统task数、story数"通常是想看这个部门的工作产出**，所以：\n\n**SQL 1 的逻辑更符合常见需求**，但建议：\n1. 确认 `dispatch_to_name = name` 这个关联是否可靠（同名问题）\n2. 考虑是否需要用 `user_id` 而不是 `name` 关联\n\n如果你能告诉我具体的业务场景（是看人的工作量还是看项目的进展），我可以给出更明确的建议。', 'role': 'assistant'}, {'content': "“汇总今年的企业累计签收额和累积融资额，并查询企业对应的核企名称及供应商层级”， 下面的两个sql 相比哪个更准确？\n\nWITH sign_agg AS\n  (SELECT `core_company_name`,\n          `company_name`,\n          SUM(`transfer_amt`) AS `total_sign_amt`\n   FROM `dw`.`dw_zhanke_wec_online_asset_list`\n   WHERE LEFT(`deal_time`, 10) >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND LEFT(`deal_time`, 10) < '2027-01-01'\n   GROUP BY `core_company_name`,\n            `company_name`),\n     fin_agg AS\n  (SELECT `core_company_name`,\n          `company_name`,\n          SUM(`fin_apply_amt`) AS `total_fin_amt`,\n          MAX(`apply_level`) AS `apply_level`\n   FROM `dw`.`dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list`\n   WHERE `deal_date` >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND `deal_date` < '2027-01-01'\n   GROUP BY `core_company_name`,\n            `company_name`),\n     all_companies AS\n  (SELECT DISTINCT `core_company_name`,\n                   `company_name`\n   FROM `sign_agg`\n   UNION SELECT DISTINCT `core_company_name`,\n                         `company_name`\n   FROM `fin_agg`)\nSELECT `a`.`core_company_name` AS `核企名称`,\n       `a`.`company_name` AS `供应商`,\n       COALESCE(`s`.`total_sign_amt`, 0) AS `累计签收金额`,\n       COALESCE(`f`.`total_fin_amt`, 0) AS `累计融资金额`,\n       `f`.`apply_level` AS `供应商层级`\nFROM all_companies `a`\nLEFT JOIN sign_agg `s` ON `a`.`core_company_name` = `s`.`core_company_name`\nAND `a`.`company_name` = `s`.`company_name`\nLEFT JOIN fin_agg `f` ON `a`.`core_company_name` = `f`.`core_company_name`\nAND `a`.`company_name` = `f`.`company_name`\nORDER BY COALESCE(`s`.`total_sign_amt`, 0) DESC\nLIMIT 1000\n\n\nWITH `FinancingData` AS\n  (SELECT `t1`.`company_name` AS `company_name`,\n          SUM(`t1`.`fin_apply_amt`) AS `fin_apply_total`,\n          GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT `t1`.`core_company_name` SEPARATOR ', ') AS `core_company_names`,\n          MIN(`t1`.`apply_level`) AS `apply_level`\n   FROM `dw`.`dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list` `t1`\n   WHERE `t1`.`fin_apply_date` >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND `t1`.`fin_apply_date` < '2027-01-01'\n   GROUP BY `t1`.`company_name`),\n     `AssetData` AS\n  (SELECT `t2`.`company_name` AS `company_name`,\n          SUM(`t2`.`transfer_amt`) AS `transfer_amt_total`\n   FROM `dw`.`dw_zhanke_wec_online_asset_list` `t2`\n   WHERE `t2`.`deal_time` >= '2026-01-01'\n     AND `t2`.`deal_time` < '2027-01-01'\n   GROUP BY `t2`.`company_name`)\nSELECT `merged`.`company_name` AS `supplier_name`,\n       `merged`.`fin_apply_total` AS `financing_amount`,\n       `merged`.`transfer_amt_total` AS `sign_amount`,\n       `merged`.`core_company_names` AS `core_company_name`,\n       `merged`.`apply_level` AS `supplier_level`\nFROM\n  (SELECT COALESCE(`f`.`company_name`, `a`.`company_name`) AS `company_name`,\n          `f`.`fin_apply_total`,\n          `f`.`core_company_names`,\n          `f`.`apply_level`,\n          `a`.`transfer_amt_total`\n   FROM `FinancingData` `f`\n   LEFT JOIN `AssetData` `a` ON `f`.`company_name` = `a`.`company_name`\n   UNION SELECT COALESCE(`f`.`company_name`, `a`.`company_name`) AS `company_name`,\n                `f`.`fin_apply_total`,\n                `f`.`core_company_names`,\n                `f`.`apply_level`,\n                `a`.`transfer_amt_total`\n   FROM `FinancingData` `f`\n   RIGHT JOIN `AssetData` `a` ON `f`.`company_name` = `a`.`company_name`) `merged`\nORDER BY `merged`.`fin_apply_total` DESC\nLIMIT 1000", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'xiaomi/mimo-v2.5-pro', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7, 'tools': [{'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_datasources', 'description': 'List datasources in the current workspace (credentials redacted).', 'parameters': {'properties': {}, 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'get_datasource', 'description': 'Get one datasource by id (credentials redacted).', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'create_datasource', 'description': 'Create a datasource. configuration is plaintext JSON; system encrypts. Requires workspace admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'name': {'description': 'Datasource name', 'type': 'string'}, 'type': {'description': 'Protocol type key, e.g. mysql/pg/excel/api (not display name)', 'type': 'string'}, 'configuration': {'additionalProperties': True, 'description': "Plain JSON object using the datasource protocol's canonical fields. SQL connections use username (never user), password, host, port, database and optional dbSchema/extraJdbc/timeout/ssl.", 'type': 'object'}, 'description': {'default': '', 'description': 'Optional description', 'type': 'string'}, 'tables': {'anyOf': [{'items': {'properties': {'table_name': {'title': 'Table Name', 'type': 'string'}, 'table_comment': {'default': '', 'title': 'Table Comment', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['table_name'], 'title': 'TableSelection', 'type': 'object'}, 'type': 'array'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Optional initial table selection'}}, 'required': ['name', 'type', 'configuration'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'update_datasource', 'description': 'Update datasource name/description/configuration/type. Conf-owned resources re-project tables from conf. Requires ws admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id to update', 'type': 'integer'}, 'name': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'New name'}, 'description': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'New description'}, 'configuration': {'anyOf': [{'additionalProperties': True, 'type': 'object'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'New plaintext configuration using canonical protocol fields; SQL connections use username, never user'}, 'type': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Protocol type key if changing type'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'check_datasource', 'description': 'Check datasource connection status.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_catalog_tables', 'description': 'Read-only: list remote catalog tables for a datasource.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_selected_tables', 'description': 'List tables currently projected into AI智能问数 metadata for a datasource.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'choose_tables', 'description': 'Update SQL-type datasource table projection. mode="add" (default) merges tables into current selection; mode="remove" drops named tables; mode="set" fully replaces selection with the input list. Conf-owned types re-project from conf instead. Requires ws admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'tables': {'items': {'properties': {'table_name': {'type': 'string'}, 'table_comment': {'default': '', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['table_name'], 'type': 'object'}, 'type': 'array'}, 'mode': {'default': 'add', 'description': 'Projection mode: "add" (default) merges tables into current selection; "remove" drops named tables from current selection; "set" replaces the entire selection with the input list. Never pass mode="set" with only newly added names — that deletes the rest.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['ds_id', 'tables'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_catalog_fields', 'description': 'Read-only: list remote catalog fields for a table name.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'table_name': {'description': 'Remote catalog table name', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['ds_id', 'table_name'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_table_fields', 'description': 'List fields stored in AI智能问数 metadata for a CoreTable id.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'table_id': {'description': 'CoreTable id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'field_name': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Optional field name filter'}}, 'required': ['table_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'update_table_meta', 'description': 'Update checked / custom_comment on a CoreTable. Requires ws admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'table_id': {'description': 'CoreTable id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'checked': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'boolean'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Whether the table is selected/enabled'}, 'custom_comment': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Custom comment stored in AI智能问数'}}, 'required': ['table_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'update_field_meta', 'description': 'Update checked / custom_comment on a CoreField. Requires ws admin.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'field_id': {'description': 'CoreField id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'checked': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'boolean'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Whether the field is selected/enabled'}, 'custom_comment': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'string'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None, 'description': 'Custom comment stored in AI智能问数'}}, 'required': ['field_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'get_sample_data', 'description': 'Protocol-level sample preview (max 3 rows x 10 fields) for an already projected table via CAP_SAMPLE_DATA. Not free SQL and not a chart pipeline. Use to validate projection; chart analysis belongs in the main NLQ chat.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'table_name': {'description': 'Already-projected table name (must exist as CoreTable under the datasource). Protocol-level sample only — not free SQL.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['ds_id', 'table_name'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_table_relations', 'description': 'List configured field relationships for a datasource.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}}, 'required': ['ds_id'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'replace_table_relations', 'description': 'Replace the complete field-relationship set for a datasource. Use list_table_relations first when preserving existing relations.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'ds_id': {'description': 'Datasource id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'relations': {'description': 'Complete set of directed field relationships', 'items': {'properties': {'source_field_id': {'description': 'Source CoreField id', 'type': 'integer'}, 'target_field_id': {'description': 'Target