oject_id和company_name作为关联条件。",\n          "impact": "关联更精确，但可能减少匹配记录，因为需要所有字段都匹配。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["schema"]\n        },\n        {\n          "id": "opt_partial_keys",\n          "label": "仅使用company_name和core_company_id关联",\n          "description": "按照查询指定，只使用这两个字段进行关联。",\n          "impact": "可能增加匹配记录，但风险是company_name可能非唯一，导致错误关联或数据膨胀。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["schema"]\n        }\n      ],\n      "allow_custom": true,\n      "custom_placeholder": "描述自定义关联条件，例如使用部分字段或其他组合"\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "q_time_filter",\n      "issue_keys": ["time.filter_application"],\n      "kind": "time",\n      "title": "确认时间过滤的应用方式",\n      "reason": "两个指标使用不同时间字段过滤，需要确定在关联前还是关联后应用条件，以正确限制数据到2026年。",\n      "selection_type": "single",\n      "required": true,\n      "recommended_option_ids": ["opt_before_join"],\n      "recommendation_reason": "在JOIN前分别过滤每个表可以减少数据量，并确保每个指标只使用正确的时间范围，避免后续复杂条件。",\n      "recommendation_strength": "strong",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "id": "opt_before_join",\n          "label": "在JOIN前分别过滤",\n          "description": "先在融资表中过滤fin_apply_date为2026年，在资产表中过滤deal_time为2026年，然后进行FULL OUTER JOIN。",\n          "impact": "只包含2026年的数据，关联后汇总，计算结果更聚焦。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["schema"]\n        },\n        {\n          "id": "opt_after_join",\n          "label": "在JOIN后应用过滤",\n          "description": "先进行FULL OUTER JOIN，然后在结果中分别检查fin_apply_date和deal_time是否为2026年。",\n          "impact": "可能包括非2026年的记录，需要复杂条件处理，易出错且性能较低。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["schema"]\n        }\n      ],\n      "allow_custom": true,\n      "custom_placeholder": "描述自定义过滤策略，例如混合方式"\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "q_aggregation",\n      "issue_keys": ["metric.aggregation"],\n      "kind": "metric",\n      "title": "确认融资额和签收额的聚合方式",\n      "reason": "用户要求“汇总”指标，但未指定聚合函数，需明确是求和、平均值还是其他方式。",\n      "selection_type": "single",\n      "required": true,\n      "recommended_option_ids": ["opt_sum"],\n      "recommendation_reason": “汇总”通常意味着求和，计算总额，符合常见业务需求。",\n      "recommendation_strength": "moderate",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "id": "opt_sum",\n          "label": "求和",\n          "description": "使用SUM(fin_apply_amt)和SUM(transfer_amt)进行聚合。",\n          "impact": "计算每个供应商的融资总额和签收总额。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["schema"]\n        },\n        {\n          "id": "opt_avg",\n          "label": "平均值",\n          "description": "使用AVG(fin_apply_amt)和AVG(transfer_amt)进行聚合。",\n          "impact": "计算每个供应商的融资平均额和签收平均额。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["schema"]\n        }\n      ],\n      "allow_custom": true,\n      "custom_placeholder": "描述其他聚合方式，如最大值、计数等"\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "q_core_company_aggregation",\n      "issue_keys": ["dimension.core_company_name_aggregation"],\n      "kind": "dimension",\n      "title": "确认核企名称的拼接聚合方式",\n      "reason": "输出核企名称需要“拼接聚合”，但具体拼接函数和去重逻辑不明确，影响输出格式。",\n      "selection_type": "single",\n      "required": true,\n      "recommended_option_ids": ["opt_group_concat"],\n      "recommendation_reason": "拼接聚合通常使用GROUP_CONCAT将多个值连接成字符串，简单直接。",\n      "recommendation_strength": "moderate",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "id": "opt_group_concat",\n          "label": "GROUP_CONCAT",\n          "description": "使用GROUP_CONCAT(core_company_name)将供应商关联的所有核企名称连接起来，可能包含重复值。",\n          "impact": "输出一个字符串，包含该供应商的所有核企名称，重复值可能影响可读性。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["schema"]\n        },\n        {\n          "id": "opt_distinct_concat",\n          "label": "去重拼接",\n          "description": "使用GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT core_company_name)去重后拼接核企名称。",\n          "impact": "输出不重复的核企名称字符串，更简洁。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["schema"]\n        }\n      ],\n      "allow_custom": true,\n      "custom_placeholder": "描述自定义拼接方式，例如使用特定分隔符或排序"\n    }\n  ],\n  "blocking_reasons": []\n}', 'role': 'assistant'}, {'content': '上一响应未通过结构校验：Cannot parse semantic clarification assessment。请仅返回修正后的完整 JSON，不要解释。', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'xiaomi/mimo-v2.5-pro', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7