um_sign_amt=350000.0, cum_fin_amt=350000.0\n  company_name=一铭产业发展（山东）集团有限公司, core_company_name=山东高速绿建发展有限公司, supplier_level=1, cum_sign_amt=200000.0, cum_fin_amt=200000.0\n  ... 共8行\n- SQL:\n```sql\nWITH `sign_agg` AS\n  (SELECT `t1`.`company_name` AS `company_name`,\n          `t1`.`core_company_name` AS `core_company_name`,\n          `t1`.`apply_level` AS `apply_level`,\n          SUM(`t1`.`orig_asset_amt`) AS `cum_sign_amt`\n   FROM `dw`.`dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list` `t1`\n   WHERE `t1`.`sign_date` >= \'2026-01-01\'\n     AND `t1`.`sign_date` < \'2027-01-01\'\n   GROUP BY `t1`.`company_name`,\n            `t1`.`core_company_name`,\n            `t1`.`apply_level`),\n     `fin_agg` AS\n  (SELECT `t2`.`company_name` AS `company_name`,\n          `t2`.`core_company_name` AS `core_company_name`,\n          `t2`.`apply_level` AS `apply_level`,\n          SUM(`t2`.`fin_apply_amt`) AS `cum_fin_amt`\n   FROM `dw`.`dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list` `t2`\n   WHERE `t2`.`fin_apply_date` >= \'2026-01-01\'\n     AND `t2`.`fin_apply_date` < \'2027-01-01\'\n   GROUP BY `t2`.`company_name`,\n            `t2`.`core_company_name`,\n            `t2`.`apply_level`),\n     `dim_keys` AS\n  (SELECT `s`.`company_name` AS `company_name`,\n          `s`.`core_company_name` AS `core_company_name`,\n          `s`.`apply_level` AS `apply_level`\n   FROM `sign_agg` `s`\n   UNION SELECT `f`.`company_name` AS `company_name`,\n                `f`.`core_company_name` AS `core_company_name`,\n                `f`.`apply_level` AS `apply_level`\n   FROM `fin_agg` `f`)\nSELECT `k`.`company_name` AS `company_name`,\n       `k`.`core_company_name` AS `core_company_name`,\n       `k`.`apply_level` AS `supplier_level`,\n       `s`.`cum_sign_amt` AS `cum_sign_amt`,\n       `f`.`cum_fin_amt` AS `cum_fin_amt`\nFROM `dim_keys` `k`\nLEFT JOIN `sign_agg` `s` ON (`k`.`company_name` <=> `s`.`company_name`)\nAND (`k`.`core_company_name` <=> `s`.`core_company_name`)\nAND (`k`.`apply_level` <=> `s`.`apply_level`)\nLEFT JOIN `fin_agg` `f` ON (`k`.`company_name` <=> `f`.`company_name`)\nAND (`k`.`core_company_name` <=> `f`.`core_company_name`)\nAND (`k`.`apply_level` <=> `f`.`apply_level`)\nORDER BY `k`.`company_name`,\n         `k`.`core_company_name`,\n         `k`.`apply_level`\nLIMIT 1000\n```\n- 展示限制:\n  - 本次仅查询并展示前 1000 行；未查询结果总数，行数上限不是 SQL 修复条件\n\n平台已经使用确定性规则冻结了以下需求完成度报告：\n{"score":99,"grade":"excellent","dimensions":[{"code":"intent_alignment","weight":25,"score":100,"weighted_score":25.0,"assessor":"program","details":[{"code":"intent_confirmed","params":{},"step_index":1}]},{"code":"contract_completeness","weight":20,"score":100,"weighted_score":20.0,"assessor":"program","details":[{"code":"contract_verified","params":{},"step_index":1}]},{"code":"sql_semantic_correctness","weight":25,"score":100,"weighted_score":25.0,"assessor":"program","details":[{"code":"sql_and_result_verified","params":{"error":""},"step_index":1}]},{"code":"answer_usability","weight":15,"score":100,"weighted_score":15.0,"assessor":"program","details":[{"code":"result_is_answerable","params":{},"step_index":1}]},{"code":"evidence_confidence","weight":10,"score":90,"weighted_score":9.0,"assessor":"program","details":[{"code":"schema_contract_evidence","params":{},"step_index":1}]},{"code":"limitation_transparency","weight":5,"score":100,"weighted_score":5.0,"assessor":"program","details":[{"code":"data_observations_disclosed","params":{},"step_index":1}]}],"observations":[{"code":"truncated_result","severity":"info","params":{"rows":1000},"step_index":1}],"passed_checks":["displayable_data","intent_contract_ready","plan_validated","query_contract_satisfied","result_structure_valid","sql_executed"],"coverage":{"returned_rows":1000,"truncated":true,"step_count":1}}\n\n用户原问题：汇总今年的企业累计签收额和累积融资额，并查询企业对应的核企名称及供应商层级\n\n直接输出完整 Markdown 报告，不要输出 JSON、action 或额外说明。\n不得修改评分、等级、各指标得分或数据观察，也不得将总结作为结果发布门禁。\n\n报告必须包含：\n## 结论\n直接回答用户问题。\n\n## SQL 生成依据与解释\n说明事实表、共享粒度、关联键、时间范围、过滤、聚合和排序依据。\n\n## 数据解读\n引用实际返回的数