"ambiguous":{},"match_count":0}}', 'role': 'user'}, {'content': '{\n  "intent_mode": "new",\n  "status": "needs_clarification",\n  "summary": "需汇总今年企业的累计签收额与累积融资额，并展示对应核企名称与供应商层级；关键金额口径、企业主体及“今年”所依据的业务日期仍不明确，需先确认后再生成可执行契约。",\n  "edits": [],\n  "issues": [\n    {\n      "slot_id": "group_enterprise",\n      "clause": "group",\n      "label": "汇总企业主体",\n      "reason": "需要明确“企业”按哪一类主体汇总，不同主体会得到完全不同的企业列表与汇总金额。",\n      "allow_omit": false,\n      "evidence_refs": ["user:question"]\n    },\n    {\n      "slot_id": "output_sign_amt",\n      "clause": "output",\n      "label": "累计签收额",\n      "reason": "“累计签收额”未对应到唯一业务金额字段，且可能与不同业务日期绑定，口径不同会直接改变汇总值。",\n      "allow_omit": false,\n      "evidence_refs": ["user:question"]\n    },\n    {\n      "slot_id": "output_fin_amt",\n      "clause": "output",\n      "label": "累积融资额",\n      "reason": "“累积融资额”通常对应融资申请金额，但仍需确认统计时点所用业务日期，日期口径不同会改变今年范围的结果。",\n      "allow_omit": false,\n      "evidence_refs": ["user:question"]\n    },\n    {\n      "slot_id": "time_window_year",\n      "clause": "time_window",\n      "label": "今年的业务时间范围",\n      "reason": "已确定“今年”为 2026-01-01 至 2027-01-01（不含），但签收额与融资额应分别按哪一个业务日期落入该年，会实质影响统计结果。",\n      "allow_omit": false,\n      "evidence_refs": ["user:question"]\n    },\n    {\n      "slot_id": "group_core_company",\n      "clause": "group",\n      "label": "核企名称",\n      "reason": "需要确认核企名称是作为汇总拆分维度，还是仅在企业维度下展示对应名称；这会影响分组粒度和金额是否被拆分。",\n      "allow_omit": false,\n      "evidence_refs": ["user:question"]\n    },\n    {\n      "slot_id": "group_supplier_level",\n      "clause": "group",\n      "label": "供应商层级",\n      "reason": "需要确认供应商层级是按层级拆分汇总，还是仅展示对应层级；是否拆分会改变每行金额。",\n      "allow_omit": false,\n      "evidence_refs": ["user:question"]\n    }\n  ],\n  "questions": [\n    {\n      "id": "q_enterprise_and_dims",\n      "slot_ids": ["group_enterprise", "group_core_company", "group_supplier_level"],\n      "title": "汇总时“企业、核企、供应商层级”如何组织？",\n      "reason": "您要求汇总企业金额，并查询对应核企名称和供应商层级；主体与是否按核企/层级拆分会决定结果行的粒度。",\n      "selection_type": "single",\n      "required": true,\n      "recommended_option_ids": ["by_supplier_core_level"],\n      "recommendation_reason": "供应链场景下，同一企业常对应不同核企与层级，按三者一起汇总最能保留“对应关系”。",\n      "recommendation_strength": "moderate",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "id": "by_supplier_core_level",\n          "label": "按原始供应商 + 核企 + 供应商层级汇总",\n          "description": "以原始供应商(company_name)为企业，并按核企名称(core_company_name)、供应商层级(apply_level)拆分统计。",\n          "impact": "同一供应商若对接多个核企或处于多层，会拆成多行，金额互不合并。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.company_name", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.core_company_name", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.apply_level"],\n          "effects": [\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_enterprise",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "group_enterprise",\n                "label": "原始供应商",\n                "source": "user",\n                "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.company_name"],\n                "clause": "group",\n                "field": {"resource": "dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list", "field": "company_name"},\n                "bucket": null\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_core_company",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "group_core_company",\n                "label": "核企名称",\n                "source": "user",\n                "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.core_company_name"],\n                "clause": "group",\n                "field": {"resource": "dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list", "field": "core_company_name"},\n                "bucket": null\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_supplier_level",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "group_supplier_level",\n                "label": "供应商层级",\n                "source": "user",\n                "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.apply_level"],\n                "clause": "group",\n                "field": {"resource": "dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list", "field": "apply_level"},\n                "bucket": null\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "id": "by_fin_applicant_core_level",\n          "label": "按申请融资企业 + 核企 + 供应商层级汇总",\n          "description": "以申请融资企业(sed_company_name)为企业，并按核企名称、供应商层级拆分统计。",\n          "impact": "企业主体变为融资申请人，与“原始供应商”口径的企业列表和金额可能不一致。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.sed_company_name", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.core_company_name", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.apply_level"],\n          "effects": [\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_enterprise",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "group_enterprise",\n                "label": "申请融资企业",\n                "source": "user",\n                "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.sed_company_name"],\n                "clause": "group",\n                "field": {"resource": "dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list", "field": "sed_company_name"},\n                "bucket": null\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_core_company",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "group_core_company",\n                "label": "核企名称",\n                "source": "user",\n                "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.core_company_name"],\n                "clause": "group",\n                "field": {"resource": "dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list", "field": "core_company_name"},\n                "bucket": null\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_supplier_level",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "group_supplier_level",\n                "label": "供应商层级",\n                "source": "user",\n                "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.apply_level"],\n                "clause": "group",\n                "field": {"resource": "dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list", "field": "apply_level"},\n                "bucket": null\n              }\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          "id": "by_enterprise_only",\n          "label": "只按企业汇总，核企与层级仅作附加展示信息不拆分",\n          "description": "仅按企业主体汇总两套金额；核企名称、供应商层级不作为拆分维度（若一企多核企/多层，需后续再定展示方式）。",\n          "impact": "每个企业一行合并全部金额；若存在多个核企或层级，不能直接唯一展示对应关系。",\n          "evidence_refs": ["user:question"],\n          "effects": [\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_enterprise",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "group_enterprise",\n                "label": "原始供应商",\n                "source": "user",\n                "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.company_name"],\n                "clause": "group",\n                "field": {"resource": "dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list", "field": "company_name"},\n                "bucket": null\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_core_company",\n              "action": "omit",\n              "requirement": null\n            },\n            {\n              "slot_id": "group_supplier_level",\n              "action": "omit",\n              "requirement": null\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      "allow_custom": true,\n      "custom_placeholder": "请说明企业指谁，以及是否按核企名称、供应商层级拆分汇总"\n    },\n    {\n      "id": "q_metrics_and_time",\n      "slot_ids": ["output_sign_amt", "output_fin_amt", "time_window_year"],\n      "title": "“累计签收额 / 累积融资额”的金额与今年统计日期如何定义？",\n      "reason": "两个汇总指标的金额字段和“今年”所依据的业务日期会直接改变统计值；已解析今年为 2026-01-01（含）至 2027-01-01（不含）。",\n      "selection_type": "single",\n      "required": true,\n      "recommended_option_ids": ["sign_orig_by_sign_date_fin_apply_by_apply_date"],\n      "recommendation_reason": "名称上分别贴近“签收日+原始资产金额”与“融资申请日期+融资申请金额”。",\n      "recommendation_strength": "moderate",\n      "options": [\n        {\n          "id": "sign_orig_by_sign_date_fin_apply_by_apply_date",\n          "label": "签收额=原始资产金额(按签收日)；融资额=融资申请金额(按融资申请日期)",\n          "description": "在融资明细中：累计签收额对签收日(sign_date)落入今年的原始资产金额(orig_asset_amt)求和；累积融资额对融资申请日期(fin_apply_date)落入今年的融资申请金额(fin_apply_amt)求和。",\n          "impact": "两套指标可能覆盖不完全相同的单据集合，因为分别按签收日与融资申请日判断是否属于今年。",\n          "evidence_refs": [\n            "user:question",\n            "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.orig_asset_amt",\n            "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.sign_date",\n            "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.fin_apply_amt",\n            "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.fin_apply_date"\n          ],\n          "effects": [\n            {\n              "slot_id": "output_sign_amt",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "output_sign_amt",\n                "label": "累计签收额",\n                "source": "user",\n                "evidence_refs": ["user:question", "schema:dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list.orig_asset_amt"],\n                "clause": "output",\n                "field": {"resource": "dw_mid_crm_wec_xun_core_fin_list", "field": "orig_asset_amt"},\n                "operation": "sum",\n                "operands": []\n              }\n            },\n            {\n              "slot_id": "output_fin_amt",\n              "action": "set",\n              "requirement": {\n                "slot_id": "output_fin_amt",\n